# ✅ 4. How does MCP call your pipeline?

Once integrated, your MCP client (VSCode, Cursor, Cline, Dust, etc.) will call:

```
/ask_llm?prompt="your question"
```

And MCP server will respond with:

```
{
  "response": "...final safe + accurate answer...",
  "accuracy": {...},
  "consistency": {...},
  "guard": {...},
  "logs": [...]
}
```

Exactly like a normal LLM tool.

